{
  "_comment": [
    "Which spoken phrase each moment on the page lands on. `cue` is a wire id: the slide id, a colon,",
    "then the local name the page writes, so data-in=\"guess\" inside <template data-slide=\"1.2\"> is",
    "1.2:guess. `on` is a word or short phrase from that section of script.md, matched ignoring case",
    "and punctuation. `occurrence` picks which match, counting from 1, and every row here names it, so",
    "a phrase the script repeats later never moves a picture by accident.",
    "`1.5:long` and `1.5:short` are the two cues the slide lists in data-owns and a handler serves."
  ],
  "sections": {
    "1": {
      "cues": [
        { "cue": "1.1:question", "on": "How does a model learn", "occurrence": 1 },
        { "cue": "1.1:examples", "on": "Here are four of them", "occurrence": 1 },
        { "cue": "1.1:rules", "on": "rules a person writes", "occurrence": 1 },
        { "cue": "1.1:name", "on": "machine learning", "occurrence": 1 },
